------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  boeing787_yoshimura at 3000 m, 133.5 m/s, heading 90 -- Yoshimura's own condition
  trim alpha -0.07 deg
  this entry's own recovery condition: 3000 m, 133.0 m/s
  LES top level is 7900 m; boeing747 cruises at 11278 m.
  THE FIELD CANNOT REACH CRUISE, so this is a comparison at ITS
  altitude and NOT the cruise-CAT check section 7 wanted from it.

